{"id":"0771a0b97a16ee5a","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-prime-number.md","title":"Prime Number","display":"df-prime-number — Prime Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-prime-number","aliases":["90-df-prime-number"],"display":"df-prime-number — Prime Number","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]","[[90-df-divisibility]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-prime-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-prime-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prime-number — Prime Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20b828a641244a9a\" href=\"?note=20b828a641244a9a\" title=\"90-df-divisibility\">90-df-divisibility</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (自然数集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mid\">\\(\\mid\\)</span> (整除关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20b828a641244a9a\" href=\"?note=20b828a641244a9a\" title=\"90-df-divisibility\">90-df-divisibility</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime} \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime} \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (prime-number predicate, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p_i)_{i\\geq1}\">\\((p_i)_{i\\geq1}\\)</span> (strictly increasing prime enumeration, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}number}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nq&gt;1\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(d\\mid q\\leftrightarrow(d=1\\lor d=q)\\bigr),\\\\\np_i\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\min\\left\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:\n\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\\land\n\\bigl|\\{r&lt;q:\\mathrm{Prime}(r)\\}\\bigr|=i-1\n\\right\\}\n\\qquad(i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}number}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\nq&gt;1\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(d\\mid q\\leftrightarrow(d=1\\lor d=q)\\bigr),\\\\\np_i\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\min\\left\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:\n\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\\land\n\\bigl|\\{r&lt;q:\\mathrm{Prime}(r)\\}\\bigr|=i-1\n\\right\\}\n\\qquad(i\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}(p)\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是素数（大于 1 且仅有 1 和自身为因子）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 开始编号；Euclid 论证保证对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&gt;0\">\\(i&gt;0\\)</span> 都存在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个素数，所以最小值定义有内容。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20b828a641244a9a\" href=\"?note=20b828a641244a9a\" title=\"90-df-divisibility\">90-df-divisibility</a> — 整除关系</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a> — 序列编码</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"20b828a641244a9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-divisibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb{N}$ (自然数集, see [[90-df-omega]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"20b828a641244a9a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mid$ (整除关系, see [[90-df-divisibility]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"20b828a641244a9a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-divisibility]] — 整除关系","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]] — 序列编码","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mid","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime} \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"(p_i)_{i\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prime\\text{-}number}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\n&\\leftrightarrow\nq>1\\land\\forall d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(d\\mid q\\leftrightarrow(d=1\\lor d=q)\\bigr),\\\\\np_i\n&\\coloneqq\n\\min\\left\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:\n\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\\land\n\\bigl|\\{r<q:\\mathrm{Prime}(r)\\}\\bigr|=i-1\n\\right\\}\n\\qquad(i\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prime}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"i>0","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1279,"backlinks":[{"id":"20b828a641244a9a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-prime-number]] — 素数"},{"id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb N$ 取 [[90-df-omega]]；$p_i$、$\\operatorname{Prime}$ 取 [[90-df-prime-number]]，$\\mid$ 取 [[90-df-divisibility]]。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90